Nivel de vechime: Nu se aplică
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Consultanță și servicii de afaceri
Tasks
Responsible for the design and implementation of the overall Azure cloud architecture, as well as the strategic development and assurance of scalability and security of the infrastructure;
Strategic consulting and contribution to the further development of the cloud infrastructure on Microsoft Azure;
Operation of a Cloud Operations Centre for the Azure tenant;
Support for the organization of the Cloud Operation Center;
Contribution to the design of IT processes within the ITSM framework;
Contribution to the creation of framework guidelines and documents for Azure cloud operations and project business;
Design, implementation, and maintenance of concepts and structures for automating infrastructure processes, e.g., using Infrastructure as Code (IaC) or Azure Resource Manager;
Development and implementation of security and backup concepts in the cloud;
Technical leadership of migrations and cloud projects in collaboration with other IT departments and external partners;
Mentoring and supporting Associate and Junior employees in the Cloud Team, as well as approving critical changes;
Supporting the Cloud Centre of Excellence and strategic decisions with technical expertise;
 Qualifications
In-depth experience with Microsoft Azure, particularly in Virtual Networks, Azure Active Directory, Azure Security Center and Azure Monitor;
Expertise in Infrastructure as Code (IaC), especially with tools such as Terraform and Azure Resource Manager (ARM);
Extensive knowledge of Azure-specific backup and disaster recovery solutions;
Experience with cloud security frameworks and best practices, e.g., Azure Policy, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and network security mechanisms;
Certifications: Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert or comparable qualifications;
Strong communication and leadership skills;
Strategic thinking , ownership and accountability;
 Things to know before departure: 
Start: by arrangement - always on the 1st and 15th of the month
Working hours: full-time (40h); 27 vacation days
Employment contract: CIM, Unlimited
Line of work: Consulting
Language skills: Fluent English language skills required (written and spoken). German is nice to have 
Flexibility & willingness to travel
Other: a valid work permit
